{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question","id":1559760,"title":"Alternate history question.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-05-04T10:19:19-07:00","id":1559760,"title":"Alternate history question.","content":"I'm working on a campaign set in an alternate early 1940s where The US stayed out of WW1, which lead to all of Europe from France to Russia becoming socialist.<br /> <br /> One aspect of this world is that the Catholic Church is split between a 'Red' and a 'White' papacy. So my question is, what happens to the Malleus Maleficarum? Do they suffer a civil war before splitting in two? Do the majority join one side or the other? Or is it still business as usual for them?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-04T10:43:48-07:00","id":1559762,"title":"","content":"I mean, how exactly do you see a 'red' papacy? Are they an actual hybridisation of Catholicism and socialism, or are they just the more realistic elements of the church adapting to the situation?<br /> <br /> Also, how do you see the MM as constituted at that time? Like, my understanding is that the involvement of the laity in the organisation is meant to be a relatively recent phenomena. So following that, the MM would presumably go wherever the core of the clergy go.<br /> <br /> I suppose it also depends on what you think of Baudolino. Is he a relatively honest Catholic who just happens to have made some compromises to continue the Vigil, or is he a fanatic of the Vigil who no longer really cares about his religion beyond it's ability to fuel it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-04T12:33:51-07:00","id":1559765,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar178_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"178\" data-vbnamecard=\"178\">Michael</a><br /> For the first question, While the 'Red' church haven't done anything absurd like syncretising Marxism, most if not all of it's clergy have socialist sympathies, many of whom rapidly filled up the now vacant higher offices, given that it's previous holders left in quite a hurry. So I'd say the latter.<br /> <br /> As for the second question, I have this half-baked idea of the laity being something mostly used by the reds for man-power purposes, assuming if the Malleus isn't 'shared' between the two churches (a quarter-baked idea if you will).<br /> <br /> As for Baudolino. I'm still thinking over how he'd react to this situation, considering how sudden and unpredictable the schism was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27062,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","user":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","date":". 05-05-2026, 09:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-04T13:08:13-07:00","id":1559766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559765#post1559765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar178_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"178\" data-vbnamecard=\"178\">Michael</a>For the first question, While the 'Red' church haven't done anything absurd like syncretising Marxism, most if not all of it's clergy have socialist sympathies, many of whom rapidly filled up the now vacant higher offices, given that it's previous holders left in quite a hurry. So I'd say the latter.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, are the 'White' clergy in the US? (That'd be kinda interesting given that how anti-Catholic the political climate in the US has been.) Or are we talking an on-going civil war in Europe? Or are we talking more the latter USSR where there are Orthodox priests who clearly dislike the communist system?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for the second question, I have this half-baked idea of the laity being something mostly used by the reds for man-power purposes, assuming if the Malleus isn't 'shared' between the two churches. A quarter-baked idea tbh. </div> </div> </div>Catholic political movements being run by the laity isn't a new idea. The MM being split seems perfectly legit to me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for Baudolino. I'm still thinking over how he'd react to this situation, considering how sudden and unpredictable the schism was. </div> </div> </div>How out of touch do you think he is? Like, the previous 50 years were filled with people talking about anarchists and socialists taking over.<br /> <br /> It's an interesting question what being a ghoul for 500 years does to a person? Like, does it leave you set in your ways?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-04T13:44:50-07:00","id":1559768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559762#post1559762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, how exactly do you see a 'red' papacy? Are they an actual hybridisation of Catholicism and socialism, or are they just the more realistic elements of the church adapting to the situation?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd expand this: what is the character of the socialist movement in this setting? What series of events precipitated it? Are the nations of Europe independent socialist states or united in some kind of internationalist federation? Did they go down a similar road to Lenin? Was there a Stalinist movement? What is their attitude towards organized religion? All major and relevant questions to the development of the Church in this setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-04T13:55:46-07:00","id":1559769,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar522_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"522\" data-vbnamecard=\"522\">Stupid Loserman</a> Yeah, I agree, those are the kinds of questions I'm be interested in. I just don't know that those are the kinds of questions everyone else is interested in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-04T15:11:57-07:00","id":1559776,"title":"","content":"Have you looked at the French Clergy during the French Revolution? The difference between &quot;Jurring&quot; and &quot;non Jurring&quot; Clergy (I'm certain I spelled that wrong) is like the RED/WHITE division you suggest.<br /> <br /> Look up Civil Constitution of the Clergy, French Revolution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-05T05:41:48-07:00","id":1559785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559768#post1559768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'd expand this: what is the character of the socialist movement in this setting? What series of events precipitated it? Are the nations of Europe independent socialist states or united in some kind of internationalist federation? Did they go down a similar road to Lenin? Was there a Stalinist movement? What is their attitude towards organized religion? All major and relevant questions to the development of the Church in this setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>1: the socialist movement has <i>far </i>more variety than OTL due to so many countries falling to revolution at once.<br /> <br /> 2: ww1 went on for another year as a result of a more isolationist USA.<br /> <br /> 3: Independent states.<br /> <br /> 4: Lenin's rather bummed at the fact that he now has genuine competition.<br /> <br /> 5: Stalin died in 1907 due to a botched interrogation.<br /> <br /> 6: The Italians are most lax regarding religion. Partly because of how many catholics were involved in the revolution, and partly because the new italian and French governments saw the propoganda opportunity of a 'red church' as being too good to pass up. Although it turned out to be not as compliant as they hoped, so the situation can be best described as 'awkward coexistence'.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559766#post1559766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, are the 'White' clergy in the US? (That'd be kinda interesting given that how anti-Catholic the political climate in the US has been.) Or are we talking an on-going civil war in Europe? Or are we talking more the latter USSR where there are Orthodox priests who clearly dislike the communist system?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, definitely not America. They're in Brazil. by the time of the campaign, the Stokholm Accords of 1924 (which officialy ended The Burning years*) had been in effect for 20 years<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559766#post1559766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Catholic political movements being run by the laity isn't a new idea. The MM being split seems perfectly legit to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now the real question is if the MM can somehow <i>operate</i> between two different papacies, both of whom consider the other to be completely illegitimate.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559766#post1559766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How out of touch do you think he is? Like, the previous 50 years were filled with people talking about anarchists and socialists taking over.<br /> <br /> It's an interesting question what being a ghoul for 500 years does to a person? Like, does it leave you set in your ways?</div> </div> </div> </div>Somebody once posted a headcanon that Baudolino is a rather special case amongst Ghouls, because he's the only one who knows how to 'purify' vitae. I rather like that, so i'll say that he's still as sharp as he was centuries ago.<br /> <br /> *TTLs WW1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27062,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","user":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","date":". 05-05-2026, 09:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-05T06:31:25-07:00","id":1559786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559766#post1559766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, are the 'White' clergy in the US? (That'd be kinda interesting given that how anti-Catholic the political climate in the US has been.) Or are we talking an on-going civil war in Europe? Or are we talking more the latter USSR where there are Orthodox priests who clearly dislike the communist system?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, definitely not America. They're in Brazil. by the time of the campaign, the Stokholm Accords of 1924 (which officialy ended The Burning years*) had been in effect for 20 years<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559766#post1559766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Catholic political movements being run by the laity isn't a new idea. The MM being split seems perfectly legit to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now the real question is if the MM can somehow <i>operate</i> between two different papacies, both of whom consider the other to be completely illegitimate.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559766#post1559766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How out of touch do you think he is? Like, the previous 50 years were filled with people talking about anarchists and socialists taking over.<br /> <br /> It's an interesting question what being a ghoul for 500 years does to a person? Like, does it leave you set in your ways?</div> </div> </div> </div>Somebody once posted a headcanon that Baudolino is a rather special case amongst Ghouls, because he's the only one who knows how to 'purify' vitae. I rather like that, so i'll say that he's still as sharp as he was centuries ago.<br /> <br /> *TTLs WW1.<br /> <br /> Can someone delete this post? I've already written it above this one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27062,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","user":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","date":". 05-18-2026, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-05T10:53:01-07:00","id":1559790,"title":"","content":"Honestly, with a popular socialist movement spreading across multiple socialist European states, independent from the Russian vanguard state socialist model, and not pursuing an active state atheism, it's sounding to me like the white papacy would be a distinct schismatic minority, with red Catholics still represented even outside the European states. I'd give the red church the witch-hammer, and if the white church can and does still maintain an active monster-hunting subset, it's more likely something between a compact and a conspiracy, making do without the established infrastructure for training witch-hunters. There are probably old witch-hunters who've schismed to the white church and taken their Benedictions with them, but it's gotten harder to teach newer priests, and priests may just generally be in short supply.<br /> <br /> The witch-hammer continuing to operate as one organization between both papacies is also a valid angle. They <i>are</i> a conspiracy, operating in secret to most of the church hierarchy, after all. Being concerned with monsters found across the world could easily bring them together more tightly than the political schism pushes them apart, resulting in red and white witch-hunters continuing to cooperate and share information and resources with their brothers, under the belief that the Vigil is the most important holy work to be done, and the schism could eventually be resolved. I like this angle. It combines simplicity with added conflict.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-18T10:13:33-07:00","id":1560064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1559760-alternate-history-question?p=1559790#post1559790\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The witch-hammer continuing to operate as one organization between both papacies is also a valid angle. They <i>are</i> a conspiracy, operating in secret to most of the church hierarchy, after all. Being concerned with monsters found across the world could easily bring them together more tightly than the political schism pushes them apart, resulting in red and white witch-hunters continuing to cooperate and share information and resources with their brothers, under the belief that the Vigil is the most important holy work to be done, and the schism could eventually be resolved. I like this angle. It combines simplicity with added conflict.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could make a great plot-thread out of this. This looming shadow of worldly ideology that seeks to split the Hammer in two. The Laity might even become a liability in such a scenario...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}